  "step_3": "The decision reason requires consideration of the maximum magnitude outcome and its weighted probability (i.e., outcome × probability). The individual does not mention the maximum magnitude outcome (2500 vs. 2400) or compute or reference the weighted value (2500×0.33 = 825 vs. 2400×1 = 2400). Instead, the individual focuses on the risk of losing the 2400 Euros in B and the certainty of A. This indicates that the individual did not use the decision reason. The justification is based on risk aversion and certainty, not on the weighted maximum magnitude outcome. Therefore, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
